</li><li>Stress Tolerance
</li><li>Quality Orientation
</li></ul><p> </p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>For any assistance or more info please contact the Nedbank Recruiting Team</p>



 +264 61 295 2155 / +264 61 295 2036
Namibia


",
